1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
Not sure what to get the caravan guy? I solved it.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:05,440
He loves that caravan more than I like to admit.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,880
So this year I wanted something he'd actually appreciate.

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,960
Not just a trinket left in a drawer.

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,040
I found a roof cover for his caravan.

6
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:15,440
It shields the roof all winter, parked outside.

7
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,840
He was really happy.

8
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,400
Not just polite.

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,320
Truly happy.

10
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,080
For once, I gave something he actually uses.

11
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:22,920
Every winter.

12
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,880
Again and again.

13
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:27,720
The best gift shows you get what they care about.
